/wiki/Dermot_Mulroney\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d174\"},\"ref\":\"d174\",\"snippet\":\" ... List of Shameless (American TV series) characters - Wikipedia\\ndate: 2014-03-23\\n---\\nname: Frank Gallagher\\nseries: Shameless (U.S.)\\ncreator: Paul Abbott\\nportrayer: William H. Macy Jacob DeMonte-Finn (young Frank)\\nfull_name: Francis Gallagher\\nspouse: Monica Gallagher (ex-wife)\\nchildren: * Fiona Gallagher (Daughter), * Lip Gallagher (Son), * Ian ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Shameless_(American_TV_series)_characters\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d106\"},\"ref\":\"d106\",\"snippet\":\" ... He continued acting in countless films and TV series until his death. Caan is survived by five children and four grandchildren.\\n\\nBrett Tuggle\\n\\nThe renowned veteran musician and celebrated keyboardist died on June 19, after a battle with cancer. He was 70. The news of his death was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.etonline.com/gallery/stars-weve-lost-in-2022-177426\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d175\"},\"ref\":\"d175\",\"snippet\":\" ... He is survived by his wife Kelly Rizzo and his three children.\\n\\nDwayne Hickman\\n\\nDwayne Hickman, the TV executive and actor best known for his role as girl-infatuated teen Dobie Gillis in the CBS sitcom The Many Loves of Dobie Gillis, died on Jan. 9 from complications ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/celebrity/stars-we-lost-in-2022/?srsltid=AfmBOoqgtseDJPvB8Bamfe3oZlhWJZaiC5kf4fxP0pjffkBximQEpPNy\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"p